:: Shopping Day 1d [unfinished] {"position":"4075,2300","size":"100,100"}
{=

(metadata:
"currency", "rial",
"title", "The Apothecaries' Floors",
"cardDesc", "Simple magical products for everyday use are often sold in alchemical shops.",
"parent", "S: Shopping Day 1",
"devNote", [itemList might need reviewing. Right now, it's selling only crafables lvl 1, but does it need to also sell some ingredients? Do ingredients need additional key tagging for easy classification?],
)

<!--Market setup-->
<!--item list-->
(set: _itemList to (a:))
(for: each _itemDM, ...(passages: where its name contains "item."))[{
     (if: _itemDM's key contains "craftable")[{
          (if: _itemDM's level is 1)[{
               (set: _itemList to it + (a: (trimmed: "item.", _itemDM's name)))
          }]
     }]
}]
<!--buy factor-->
(set: _buyFactors to (passage: "table.marketPriceMod")'s universalBuy)
<!--sell factor-->
(set: _sellFactors to ($funcMarketMergeFactors: _buyFactors, (passage: "table.marketPriceMod")'s universalSell))
<!--define base mods-->
(set: _baseBuyMod to 3)
(set: _baseSellMod to .9)
<!--end of market setup-->


$cssColumnParent[

$cssColumnChild[

	(css: "font-size: 70%")[
        $cssColumnChild[(link: "⇦ Never mind.")[(goto: (passage:)'s parent)]]
     ]

	$cssBox[
    	($funcImage: (passage: "S: Shopping Day 1")'s img)
         $cssBoxItem[''(print: (passage:)'s title )''<br>(print: (passage:)'s cardDesc)]
    ]
]

$cssColumnChild[
Highly trained magi are few, but half-trained, self-trained, and untrained ones are plenty. Those versed in a few alchemical tricks often find employment in small laboratories, churning out minor remedies, supplements, cosmetics, and even cleaning substances.
<br>
Of course, if business employs a non-guild magus, it is not permitted to sell at guild prices - Exchange rules. You're not sure if you have seen a guild certification in any of these shops. It seems that your own coin purse will have to bear the difference. 

]<!--end child-->
]<!--end parent-->

---

$cssColumnParent[
$cssColumnChild[
<!--Readout-->
$cssDesc[($funcMarketReadoutFull: _baseBuyMod, _baseSellMod, _itemList, _buyFactors, _sellFactors)]
<!--end of readout-->
]<!--end child, begin another-->

$cssColumnChild[
<!--main buy/sell menu-->
<ol>
($funcMarketMain: _baseBuyMod, _baseSellMod, (passage:)'s currency, _itemList, _buyFactors, _sellFactors, 1)
<br>
Or...
<br>
<li>(link: "Never mind.")[(goto: (passage:)'s parent)]</li>
</ol>
<!--end of main buy/sell menu-->

]<!--end child-->
]<!--end parent 2-->